sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Administrator
    participant Helm as Helm CLI
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(OpenShift only)
    participant Operator as RHAI Operator<br/>Deployment
    participant HookCR as Post-Install Hook<br/>(CRs Job)
    participant HookGW as Post-Install Hook<br/>(Gateway Job)
    participant HookMaaS as Post-Install Hook<br/>(MaaS Gateway Job)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant GitHub as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Admin,Operator: Flow 1: Helm Chart Installation (xKS)
        Admin->>Helm: helm install rhai rhai-on-xks-chart/
        Helm->>K8sAPI: Apply templates (Deployment, CRDs, RBAC,<br/>ServiceAccount, Webhooks, Cloud Manager)
        K8sAPI-->>Helm: Resources created
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Schedule Operator Pod<br/>SA: rhai-operator-controller-manager
        Note over HookCR: Hook weight 1
        K8sAPI->>HookCR: Run post-install CRs Job
        HookCR->>K8sAPI: Create KubernetesEngine CR<br/>Create Platform CR<br/>Create KServe CR
        HookCR->>K8sAPI: Create AIGateway CR (optional)
        Note over HookGW: Hook weight 2
        K8sAPI->>HookGW: Run post-install Gateway Job
        HookGW->>CertMgr: Wait for CA certificate (rhai-ca)
        CertMgr-->>HookGW: CA ready
        HookGW->>K8sAPI: Create GatewayClass<br/>Create inference Gateway<br/>Create TLS Certificate<br/>Create CA ConfigMap
        Note over HookMaaS: Hook weight 3
        K8sAPI->>HookMaaS: Run post-install MaaS Job
        HookMaaS->>K8sAPI: Create MaaS GatewayClass<br/>Create MaaS Gateway<br/>Create MaaS TLS Certificate
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile components<br/>(watch Platform, KServe, KE CRs)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over GitHub,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Helm Chart Sync to RHOAI-Build-Config
        Note over GitHub: Trigger: push to rhoai-X.Y branch
        GitHub->>GitHub: helm-sync.yml workflow starts
        GitHub->>GitHub: Checkout odh-gitops<br/>(GitHub App Token)
        GitHub->>GitHub: Checkout RHOAI-Build-Config<br/>(GitHub App Token)
        GitHub->>GitHub: rsync charts/ →<br/>to-be-processed/helm/
        GitHub->>GitHub: Push to RHOAI-Build-Config<br/>(GitHub App Token)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 230)
        Note over GitHub,Operator: Flow 3: XKS Bundle Auto-Update
        Note over GitHub: Trigger: Cron daily 6:00 UTC
        GitHub->>GitHub: update-rhai-xks-bundle.yaml starts
        GitHub->>GitHub: Clone rhods-operator<br/>(GITHUB_TOKEN)
        GitHub->>GitHub: kustomize build +<br/>helmtemplate-generator
        GitHub->>GitHub: Create PR on odh-gitops<br/>(GITHUB_TOKEN)
    end
